 "caveats": "Model: laya-dhristi v4 = v3 plus 3 epochs on train_v4.jsonl (25% free-text steps), top 6 of 28 layers, CPU. Top choice correct on 28 of 41 scenes (v3 19, zero-shot 17). At the default 0.9 it acts on 15 scenes with 80% precision (36 of 45 decisions) and is wrong on three: two-fields-second (finish), already-logged-in (click #acct) and rename-free (click #rename at 0.91), a step that needs free text. Jev at 0.9 was 39 of 39 on held-out. The free-text answer did not learn the cue: 0.24-0.35 on the four steps that need free text and up to 0.44 elsewhere, about the training share (25%). Not safe to deploy at any threshold measured here (0.95 still acts wrongly on already-logged-in). LLM rows reused from fastpath-bench-v01.json; synthetic scenes written by us."
